  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hcyklRW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"29\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9gPxiOR.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"113\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>只需 10 個模組，即可在原版 Minecraft 中享受更多農耕🚜、釣魚🐟、烹飪🍳、動物🐸 與 鄉村美學🍂</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">（非常適合與沒有高階設備的人一起遊玩田園風模組包）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong> 包含的模組：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;JEI 查閱配方</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸ 農夫樂事 [🚜🍳]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸ Alex 的生物 [🐸]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;Alex 的樂事（連結前兩者）</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;水產養殖 [🐟]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;Crayfish 先生的家具 [🍂]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;神秘農業 [🚜]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;自然指南針（尋找新生物群系）[🐸🐟]</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">以及一些讓它們順利運作的前置模組。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">[備註：</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">可惜的是，<strong>Optifine</strong> 模組無法包含在模組包基底中使用 :( 因此建議您自行從外部安裝，以獲得更好的效能或光影效果。]</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong> 為了更好的田園模式體驗，我建議：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;使用這個材質包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fjolicraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://jolicraft.com/</a> 或類似材質</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸在背景播放一些輕鬆的播放清單，例如：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0gi5-mEVEc4\" rel=\"nofollow\">星露谷物語 - 原聲帶</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m_XiWjaxNy8\" rel=\"nofollow\">田園風播放清單，讓你彷彿置身大自然</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHMMXyM6EfI\" rel=\"nofollow\">山丘小屋之歌 🍄【器樂田園風播放清單】</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OmXJqHe1c2Q\" rel=\"nofollow\">𝘮𝘪𝘯𝘦𝘤𝘳𝘢𝘧𝘵 𝘳𝘦𝘭𝘢𝘹𝘪𝘯𝘨 𝘮𝘶𝘴𝘪𝘤 🌿 𝘸𝘪𝘵𝘩 1.18 𝘴𝘰𝘯𝘨𝘴</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">▸&nbsp;如果你能使用光影，何樂而不為呢？ <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eLUthp8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"68\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hcyklRW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"29\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
